# Facts of the two UNITY_MCP_REFLECT call sites in middleware_pipeline.py: _apply_state_tracking
# (the verify_snapshot fallback) and _apply_reflection_and_hinter (the async reflect() rule engine).
# Both sites previously re-read os.environ.get("UNITY_MCP_REFLECT", "1") independently -- a literal
# duplicate whose default could drift between the two copies. One decision, one source of truth.
CONTRACT unitymcp.reflectgate
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE reflectgate_facts
FACT reflect.envOn bool
FACT reflect.resultDegraded bool
FACT reflect.noReflectFlag bool
FACT reflect.cmdIsWrite bool
FACT reflect.cmdIsSetProperty bool
FACT reflect.hasPropAndValue bool
INPUT reflectGate reflect.envOn reflect.resultDegraded reflect.noReflectFlag reflect.cmdIsWrite reflect.cmdIsSetProperty reflect.hasPropAndValue
